Unicode Character Database and Unicode emoji data (src/unicode_data.cpp)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

The tables in src/unicode_data.cpp are generated (by tools/generate_unicode.py)
from the Unicode Character Database and the Unicode emoji data files, version
17.0.0 (UnicodeData.txt, SpecialCasing.txt, CaseFolding.txt,
DerivedCoreProperties.txt, PropList.txt, DerivedNormalizationProps.txt,
Scripts.txt, ScriptExtensions.txt, PropertyValueAliases.txt,
extracted/DerivedBinaryProperties.txt, extracted/DerivedGeneralCategory.txt,
emoji/emoji-data.txt, emoji-sequences.txt and emoji-zwj-sequences.txt:
https://www.unicode.org/Public/17.0.0/), which carry the following licence.
Changes: the data are transformed into C++ tables.

